<title>FRANCE: Algerian Peugeot unit posts $9,755 profit.</title>
<headline>Algerian Peugeot unit posts $9,755 profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Algerian sudsidiary of French car maker Peugeot showed 536,507 dinars ($9,755) profit in 1995, the official Algerian news agency APS reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The subsidiary, known as Peugeot-Algeria, posted a 223.4 million dinars ($4.06 million) turnover in 1995, said APS without giving comparative figures.</p>
